                <formatted-text>
                  <run>Adjust Min. Orders filter (first row, right) to exclude data points that represent fewer orders, thus avoiding &quot;noisy data.&quot; This would be especially helpful when diving deep into specific Contact Reasons.
</run>
                  <run bold='true' underline='true'>Note:</run>
