                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>Adjust Min. Orders filter (first row, right) to exclude data points that represent fewer orders, thus avoiding &quot;noisy data.&quot; This would be especially helpful when diving deep into specific Contact Reasons.
</run>
                    <run bold='true' underline='true'>Note:</run>
                    <run> FCR only applies to contacts with a </run>
                    <run bold='true'>valid order</run>
                    <run>, and is calculated per Order-Contact Reason, not per Order. This applies at the </run>
                    <run bold='true'>Stakeholder</run>
                    <run> level i.e. calculated independently for Customer contacts and for Vendor contacts.</run>
