              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11083' id='55' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='15167'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true'>First Contact Resolution (% FCR)</run>
                  <run> = Number of Order Id / Stakeholder Id / CR3 combinations divided by all Contacts.
- all escalations and contacts leading to escalations are non FCR
- in case contact is not related to an order, we consider it FCR if for the Stakeholder Id / CR3 there is not repeated contact within 48h.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Ghostless FCR = </run>
                  <run>same as %FCR, however does not consider ghost chats (no message from stakeholder) as repeated contacts.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Order Level First Contact Resolution (% Order Level FCR)</run>
                  <run> = Number of Orders with only one contact/ Number of total Orders with at least one contact

</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#fefaf1' />
